cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
title: DifferentialLab
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mata Ali
    given-names: Alejandro
    email: alejandro.mata.ali@gmail.com
license: MIT
version: 0.4.1
date-released: "2026-02-18"
repository-code: https://github.com/DOKOS-TAYOS/DifferentialLab
url: https://differentiallab.readthedocs.io/en/latest/
abstract: >-
  Numerical solver for ODEs, difference equations, and PDEs with a Python GUI.
  Includes SciPy integrators (RK45, Radau, BDF, and others), vector systems,
  function transforms (Fourier, Laplace, and related), complex-problem plugins,
  and CSV/PNG/MP4 export.
keywords:
  - differential-equations
  - ODE
  - PDE
  - numerical-methods
  - scientific-computing
  - scipy
  - tkinter
